Error [jet.FieldWriteWithoutMarker]: Cannot edit `n` — `self` has read access only
  --> tests/ui/self_field_assign_not_mut.jet:5:14
    |
  5 |         self.n += 1
    |              ^
 Why: Editing a field requires write access to the owning place
 Fix: Declare the receiver with the write mark: `&self`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0205
